+# Replace BOTH example serial numbers with the numbers from tools/list_realsense.py.
+# gripperCam + bevCam use RealSense; baseCam remains your existing USB RGB camera.
+# If you have only one RealSense, convert the other camera back to its OpenCV configuration.
